/T (CitePrism is a modern system for auditing academic manuscripts on citation relevance, with a focus on evaluating self-citations. By leveraging Large Language Models \(LLMs\) and embedding techniques, CitePrism ensures clarity in scholarly practices by detecting off-topic citations, ranking references by relevance, and generating audit-ready reports. )
/E (CitePrism is a modern system for auditing academic manuscripts on citation relevance, with a focus on evaluating self-citations. By leveraging Large Language Models \(LLMs\) and embedding techniques, CitePrism ensures clarity in scholarly practices by detecting off-topic citations, ranking references by relevance, and generating audit-ready reports. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
